#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""yitc-v2 CLI body — V2 self-tooling per D-0017 Phase 2.

Imported by the thin entry shim `bin/yitc-v2` (T-11319). It lives here, as an ordinary
importable module, so CPython byte-caches it: a `__main__` script is re-compiled on every
single invocation, which cost 116ms of a 260ms run across the ~1316 CLI executions one
verify pass makes.

Subcommands:
  event <type> [--task ID] [--data JSON] [--commit SHA] [--stage N]
      Append one JSON line to events.jsonl per AGENTS.md §events.jsonl schema.
  task file --title T --class C --priority P --scope S [...] [--from-stdin]
      Allocate next T-NNNN ID, validate schema, write tasks/T-NNNN-<slug>.yaml,
      emit task_filed event. Per QUEUE.md §YAML schema.
  graph build
      Walk specs/patterns/plans/errors + canonical-doc rules → graph/index.json
      (committed). Per GRAPH.md §Build tool. (T-0491: the task/decision/commit/event/
      audit_verdict node-types were cut; the build no longer indexes git from: trailers
      or events.jsonl as graph sections.)
  graph query <id> | --type <node-type>
      Point lookup (SPEC/file; T/D re-sourced from authored YAML) or list nodes by type.
      Per GRAPH.md §Query CLI.

See: tasks/T-0006-*.yaml, tasks/T-0007-*.yaml, tasks/T-0008-*.yaml
"""
