# ONE authoritative structure models every source a session_ref may be resolved FROM.
# Consumed by: _resolve_session_ref_with_source (the session-start bootstrap + T-0557 forensic
# source_kind) + _assert_modeled_source_kind. It is NO LONGER consumed by the governance keyer
# `_resolve_session_ref` (T-10149 rewrote that to provider-blind rediscovery) — so a grep of the
