#   "env" — the ordered env-var carriers; first non-empty wins (the `env:<NAME>` source
#           class). Ordered precedence is the deterministic D-0030/SPEC-0002 contract.
#   "arg" — the explicit CLI --session-ref carrier is modeled (the `arg` source class).
