    """Thin injecting residue — delegates to lib.nightly.cmd_nightly (T-9544, SPEC-0105).

    Reads every host global / helper by BARE name HERE (call time) and injects them, so a monkeypatch
    on any host name (REGISTRY_PATH / EVENTS_PATH via _append_event / …) stays honored. Body lives in
    bin/lib/nightly.py.
    """
    # SPEC-0143 Rule 4 (T-10173): inject the shared-log cross collaborators so a drift on a gate-backed
